# vibes_aim — server environment

Copy this file to `.env` and fill values. `.env` is gitignored.

```env
# port to listen on
PORT=3000

# public origin (for CORS allow-list)
ORIGIN=http://127.0.0.1:4173

# market data provider
MARKET_PROVIDER=finnhub
FINNHUB_TOKEN=

# Supabase (optional). If empty, the server boots with an in-memory store
# (single-process only; do not use in production).
SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY=

# aim hit rate limit (max hits per second per session)
AIM_HIT_RPS=15
# simulated unit minted per hit (in the ticker the player is currently farming)
AIM_HIT_UNIT=0.0008
# simulated price impact / market momentum (used later in /portfolio/order)
AIM_PRICE_IMPACT_MAX=0.018
```
